### Todos los clientes
GET http://localhost:5005/clientes

### Obtener a un cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:5005/clientes/3

### Crear un cliente
POST http://localhost:5005/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Roberto Carlos",
    "apellido": "Mamani Quispe",
    "telefono": "123876",
    "ci": "14415003 LP",
    "licencia": "LIC-1321"
}

### Modificar un cliente
PUT http://localhost:5005/clientes/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Roberto C",
    "apellido": "Mamani Q",
    "telefono": "123876",
    "ci": "14415003 LP",
    "licencia": "LIC-1321"   
}

### Eliminar un cliente
DELETE http://localhost:5005/clientes/3

