### Todos los vehiculo
GET http://localhost:5005/vehiculos

### Obtener a un vehiculo por ID
GET http://localhost:5005/vehiculos/4

### Crear un vehiculo
POST http://localhost:5005/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Toyota",
    "modelo": "Hilux",
    "anio": 2025,
    "precioDia": "80.00",
    "placa": "9012-ABI",
    "color": "Negro",
    "foto": "hilux.jpg",
    "descripcion": "Ideal para todo terreno",
    "disponible": true
}

### Modificar un vehiculo
PUT http://localhost:5005/vehiculos/4
